'''Battle UFO''' (バトルバルーンUFO, ''Batorubarūn yūfō'') is a [[:Category:Floating Enemies|Floating]] enemy that appears in the [[Castle & Dragon Collaboration Event]]. It was added in [[Version 4.6 Update|Version 4.6]].

{{Enemy Info
|name = Battle UFO
|image = E 225.png
|appearance = [[Castle & Dragon Collaboration Event]]
|money drop = 800円 - 3,160円
}}

==Enemy==
A somewhat pathetic enemy, not much going for it stat wise other than its health and range.

==Strategy==
Since this is a [[:Category:Floating Enemies|Floating Enemy]], any [[:Category:Anti-Floating Cats|Anti-Floating Cats]] can deal with it, notably [[Swimmer Cat (Super Rare Cat)|Butterfly Cat]] and [[Kotatsu Cat (Super Rare Cat)|Sadako Cat]].

